---
code: K0003
title: Unterminated String
severity: ERROR
since: 0.1.0
category: parse
deprecated: false
---

A string literal was opened with [`"`]{.expected} but reached the end of the line or file without a closing [`"`]{.expected}.

In Kura, double-quoted string literals cannot span across raw newlines without escaping.

Example of erroneous code:

```kura
let greeting = "Hello, Kura!;
```

Close the string literal before the end of the line:

```kura
let greeting = "Hello, Kura!";
```

::: tip
If you meant to include a literal double quote inside the string, escape it as `\"`.
:::
